"","description":"41","card_type":"comments","type":"comments","url":"","style":null,"length":0,"continue_watching_progress":0}],"id":0,"title":"Comments","section_type":"comments"}],"post_info":{"genres":["Drama","Thriller","Mystery"],"id":8560,"type":"MOVIE","title":"Insomnia","logo":"","image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk50/shows/64867ae6-add7-4953-8359-dd9a26322ad0.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk56/shows/7cdafe69-beaf-489b-8320-3c8b9355c1f4.jpg","likes":260,"dislikes":3,"views":18761,"release_date":"1022198400000","length":7093,"description":"Sent from the city to investigate the murder of a teenage girl in a small Alaska town, a police detective (Pacino) accidentally shoots his own partner while trying to apprehend a suspect. Instead of admitting his guilt, the detective is given an unexpected alibi, but this \"solution\" only multiplies the emotional complexity and guilt over his partner's death. He's also still got a murder to solve, in addition to the blackmail and framing of an innocent bystander being orchestrated by the man they were chasing. There's also a local detective (Swank) who is conducting her own personal investigation... of his partner's death. Will it all come crashing down on him?","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":7.2}],"value":7.2,"age":"R"},"episode_id":8560,"content_control":"FAMILY"}}